{"matched":47,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0487a01","n":"0487a","t":"後半結唯識長行自解不能煩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0487b01","n":"0487b","t":"謂識變是實我法似我法故其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0487c01","n":"0487c","t":"無所變之外境外境通有能取"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0488a01","n":"0488a","t":"不離識法其真如及心所等亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0488b01","n":"0488b","t":"十地經名體言唯心者心識是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0488c01","n":"0488c","t":"文上下非一不能繁指述曰今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0489a01","n":"0489a","t":"切凡夫已得實境由境非妄故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0489c01","n":"0489c","t":"即恐他以七八二識為不定過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0490a01","n":"0490a","t":"無或空即其理識即俗事初離"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0490b01","n":"0490b","t":"為異義意大同下成前義故說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0490c01","n":"0490c","t":"現見世間非情物處時二事決"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0491a01","n":"0491a","t":"故如餘髮等第二云復有何因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0491b01","n":"0491b","t":"以因言許無隨一失言如是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0491c01","n":"0491c","t":"世尊於契經中說十二處但應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0492a01","n":"0492a","t":"二處喻二十唯識復說頌言依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0492c01","n":"0492c","t":"此同下文第五色相非心難外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0493a01","n":"0493a","t":"及非色識若無所變似色亂因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0493b01","n":"0493b","t":"有現覺此中文總意含二種以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0493c01","n":"0493c","t":"如夢覺時知彼唯心也此同攝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0494a01","n":"0494a","t":"他心之影於自心上現名了他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0494b01","n":"0494b","t":"誰說無涅槃菩提果故有何法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0494c01","n":"0494c","t":"中有七頌合為二段初二頌釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0495a01","n":"0495a","t":"法體彼舉譬喻亦不相違又互"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0495b01","n":"0495b","t":"若爾增上果亦爾有疎遠非種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0495c01","n":"0495c","t":"本識中種非謂持種名為識種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0496a01","n":"0496a","t":"見等類眾多故言彼彼彼彼者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0496b01","n":"0496b","t":"因緣宗廣一切種等句餘緣宗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0496c01","n":"0496c","t":"皆能熏唯除六識中業所招者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0497a01","n":"0497a","t":"此非因緣耶以本識中各自種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0497b01","n":"0497b","t":"現識及心所者出緣體唯見自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0497c01","n":"0497c","t":"定生者即顯後果雖經久遠如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0498a01","n":"0498a","t":"八十說入無餘心前先入滅定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0498b01","n":"0498b","t":"者何界有漏後生無漏述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0498c01","n":"0498c","t":"故今言唯欲界有初發心及留"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0499a01","n":"0499a","t":"心故以下諸地發理無違約處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0499b01","n":"0499b","t":"易亦應許有欲界發心至上界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0499c01","n":"0499c","t":"後還出觀有漏無漏故互相生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0500b01","n":"0500b","t":"五識初起雖必在欲界後起亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0500c01","n":"0500c","t":"帶有二義若古西方師釋己者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0501a01","n":"0501a","t":"鏡等所緣緣不同心等雖無分"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0501b01","n":"0501b","t":"然離彼法心亦生故餘如樞要"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0501c01","n":"0501c","t":"變他根及種不可受用故及死"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0502a01","n":"0502a","t":"違顯與違順能為緣與後生異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0502b01","n":"0502b","t":"說是順所生此緣之果若違之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0502c01","n":"0502c","t":"心為此根也問此相見道在真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0503a01","n":"0503a","t":"勝法求證未知愁慼欲證亦有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0503b01","n":"0503b","t":"道亦修以時促無差別所以不"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷007b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":115,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}